\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ferwater</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Fungi Finds</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$8,400</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Decoration</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.3.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">February 10th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\nThe <b>Kallostide</b> is an item that can be purchased from <a href=\"/wiki/Fungi_Finds\" title=\"Fungi Finds\">Fungi Finds</a> for $8,400. It is a decorative mask on a stand.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">Appearance</span></h2>\n<p>The Kallostide is a featureless mask with two holes in the place of eyes, placed upon an angled stand. When unboxed, the Kallostide picks one of five random colors (yellow, blue, red, green, and brown) and one of four different materials (metal, foil, bricks, and granite), resulting in 20 potential combinations.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 300px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/dd/Kallostide_Collection.png/revision/latest?cb=20230921213706\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"All variations of the Kallostide\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/dd/Kallostide_Collection.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/300?cb=20230921213706\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"310\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Kallostide Collection.png\" data-image-key=\"Kallostide_Collection.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Kallostide_Collection.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">All variations of the Kallostide</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure> <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This item was made by a contributor by the name of Duogon.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260901055932\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.033 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.040 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 71/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 97/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019434/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTrans